<section class="led-intro"><div class="led-eyebrow">SIMWORX LED VISUAL SYSTEMS</div><h1>Configure your LED visual system.</h1><p>Curved and hemispherical LED screens built around your simulator. Configure your screen and equipment, then print or email your quote.</p><p id="led-pricing-notice" class="led-pricing-notice" hidden role="note"></p><div class="led-intro-meta"><span>Live parametric 3D preview</span><span>Custom geometry review</span><span>Your configured quotation</span></div></section>
<section class="led-buyer-intro" aria-labelledby="led-buyer-intro-title"><div><span class="led-step">NEW TO LED SCREENS?</span><h2 id="led-buyer-intro-title">Make each choice with a little help.</h2><p>Start with pixel pitch, then work through your screen and options. Ask the LED Buyer Help Bot along the way.</p></div><button class="led-button led-primary" type="button" data-buyer-help disabled>LED Buyer Help Bot</button></section>
<section class="led-estimate-bar" aria-label="Running configuration estimate">
<div class="led-estimate-currency"><label for="led-currency">Display currency</label><select id="led-currency" data-led-select="currency" aria-describedby="led-location-help"></select></div>
<div class="led-running-price" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><span id="led-running-title">Estimated configuration price</span><strong id="led-running-total">Calculating screen cost…</strong><small id="led-running-note">Excludes tax, shipping and travel.</small></div>
<a class="led-button led-primary" href="#led-review">Review quote ↓</a>
<p id="led-location-help" class="led-sr-only">Choose your display currency. Display currency is independent of installation country. Tax and delivery are excluded from the quote.</p><p id="led-currency-reference" class="led-currency-reference"></p>
</section>
<section class="led-workbench" aria-label="LED screen configurator">
<div class="led-shape-bar"><div><span class="led-step">01 / SCREEN GEOMETRY</span><h2>Start with the shape.</h2></div><fieldset class="led-shapes"><legend class="led-sr-only">Screen geometry</legend><label><input type="radio" name="led-geometry" value="curved" checked><span><b>Curved</b><small>Cylindrical screen</small></span></label><label><input type="radio" name="led-geometry" value="hemispherical"><span><b>Hemispherical</b><small>Configurable spherical segment</small></span></label></fieldset></div>
<div id="led-pitch-options" class="led-pitch-options" aria-label="Choose pixel pitch"></div>
<div class="led-controls" id="led-controls">
<section class="led-panel"><div class="led-panel-head"><h2>Define your screen</h2><a class="led-preview-link" href="#led-preview">See 3D preview ↑</a></div><div class="led-unit-selector"><label for="led-dimension-unit">Dimensions</label><select id="led-dimension-unit"><option value="metric">Metric · metres</option><option value="imperial">Imperial · feet</option></select></div><p class="led-section-help">Adjust the sliders or enter dimensions directly. Preview ranges are guides, not manufacturing limits.</p>
