t. Shipping, travel and accommodation are confirmed separately; specialist spherical systems may require onsite commissioning.\"},{\"key\":\"warranty\",\"collection\":\"warranties\",\"title\":\"Warranty\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"on\":\"extended\",\"off\":\"standard\",\"label\":\"Add 5-year extended warranty\",\"priceLine\":\"warranty\",\"help\":\"Standard cover is included. Add the 5-year extended warranty for extended cover; full terms are confirmed with quotation.\"},{\"key\":\"warpFile\",\"collection\":\"warpFiles\",\"title\":\"Preconfigured warp file\",\"type\":\"checkbox\",\"on\":\"yes\",\"off\":\"no\",\"label\":\"Add a starting warp / calibration file\",\"priceLine\":\"warpFile\",\"help\":\"A starting configuration based on your geometry and visual setup. Compatibility, scope and final calibration are confirmed during review.\"},{\"key\":\"warpSoftware\",\"collection\":\"warpSoftware\",\"title\":\"Warp & calibration software\",\"type\":\"radio\",\"priceLine\":\"warpSoftware\",\"wide\":true,\"help\":\"Choose existing software, a home-use recommendation or a professional-use recommendation. The compatible product and licence are confirmed in your quotation.\"}],\"simulatorReferences\":[{\"id\":\"helicopter\",\"label\":\"Helicopter cockpit (H135)\",\"exampleDimensions\":{\"simulatorWidth\":1.94016,\"simulatorDepth\":2.023262,\"simulatorHeight\":1.880089},\"referenceSource\":\"Supplied H135 STEP cockpit and base\"},{\"id\":\"fighter\",\"label\":\"Fighter cockpit\",\"exampleDimensions\":{\"simulatorWidth\":1.1,\"simulatorDepth\":2.0,\"simulatorHeight\":1.65}},{\"id\":\"airliner\",\"label\":\"Airliner cockpit\",\"exampleDimensions\":{\"simulatorWidth\":2.4,\"simulatorDepth\":2.6,\"simulatorHeight\":2.1}},{\"id\":\"light-twin\",\"label\":\"Light twin cockpit\",\"exampleDimensions\":{\"simulatorWidth\":1.7,\"simulatorDepth\":1.9,\"simulatorHeight\":1.9}},{\"id\":\"car\",\"label\":\"Car / racing cockpit\",\"exampleDimensions\":{\"simulatorWidth\":1.5,\"simulatorDepth\":2.0,\"simulatorHeight\":1.4}}],\"curvedPitchAliases\":{\"p1.2\":\"p1.25\",\"p1.5\":\"p1.538\"},\"buyerGuide\":{\"version\":1,\"payment\":{\"threshold\":10000,\"thresholdCurrency\":\"EUR\",\"thresholdBasis\":\"quote\",\"depositPercent\":50,\"smallOrderPercent\":100,\"balanceDue\":\"Before shipping\",\"status\":\"Confirmed by Simworx 2026-10-20\"},\"walkthrough\":[\"pitch\",\"geometry\",\"cockpit\",\"controller\",\"spares\",\"warranty\",\"installation\",\"warp\",\"quote\"],\"topics\":[{\"id\":\"pitch\",\"title\":\"1. Choose your pixel pitch\",\"target\":\"led-pixelPitch\",\"keywords\":[\"pixel pitch\",\"pitch\",\"pixels\",\"resolution\",\"clarity\",\"clearer\",\"gaming\",\"gamer\",\"enthusiast\",\"0.9\",\"1.25\",\"certified\",\"certification\",\"public\"],\"answer\":[\"Pixel pitch is the distance between LED pixels. Smaller values give a finer image and usually matter most when you sit close to the screen. Pitch has a major effect on image detail and price.\",\"For professional training or public-facing use, Simworx recommends starting with 1.25 mm or 0.9 mm for a finer image. Pixel pitch alone does not establish certification; any certification requirements need a separate discussion with Simworx.\",\"For gaming or enthusiast use, compare the available pitches with your viewing distance and budget. Use “Which Pixel Pitch?” to see an illustrative comparison.\"],\"question\":\"Which pixel pitch should I choose?\"},{\"id\":\"geometry\",\"title\":\"2. Set the screen shape and size\",\"target\":\"led-controls\",\"keywords\":[\"geometry\",\"shape\",\"curved\",\"cylindrical\",\"hemisphere\",\"hemispherical\",\"dome\",\"diameter\",\"dimension\",\"fov\",\"field of view\",\"upper\",\"lower\",\"trim\",\"module\",\"320\",\"160\",\"240\",\"120\",\"frame\"],\"answer\":[\"Choose Curved for a cylindrical wraparound screen, or Hemispherical for independent upward and downward coverage. Diameter sets the curvature; horizontal field of view sets how far the screen wraps around you.\",\"Curved screens use whole landscape modules. Most pitches use 320 × 160 mm modules; 0.9 mm uses 240 × 120 mm. The calculator rounds width and active height to whole modules and prices the module count.\",\"For hemispherical screens, upper and lower coverage work independently. Raise/lower moves the complete screen without changing its shape. Custom frame required — POA. These systems are custom-made and generate an enquiry for a separately prepared quotation.\"],\"question\":\"What is different about a hemispherical screen?\"},{\"id\":\"cockpit\",\"title\":\"3. Add your simulator\",\"target\":\"led-preview\",\"keywords\":[\"cockpit\",\"simulator model\",\"reference\",\"base\",\"platform\",\"raise\",\"lower cockpit\",\"position\",\"height of cockpit\"],\"answer\":[\"Tick Add simulator above the viewer and choose a cockpit type. Adjust width, depth, height and position in Simulator size & position. Raise/lower cockpit represents a platform or a taller base.\",\"The reference helps you visualise proportions. It does not verify pilot eye position, clearance, access or structural suitability; Simworx will review those with you.\"],\"question\":\"Can I place my cockpit inside the screen?\"},{\"id\":\"controller\",\"title\":\"4. Choose the operating equipment\",\"target\":\"led-hardware\",\"keywords\":[\"controller\",\"processor\",\"hardware\",\"equipment\",\"computer\",\"power\",\"cabling\",\"cables\",\"own system\"],\"answer\":[\"Leave Include Simworx system controller ticked if you need our controller. Untick it if you will provide your own compatible controller.\",\"An LED installation also needs compatible receiving/sending hardware, power, cabling, mounting and setup. The listed operating requirements identify the system scope; Simworx confirms models, quantities and compatibility before order.\"],\"question\":\"Do I need the system controller?\"},{\"id\":\"spares\",\"title\":\"5. Select spare modules\",\"target\":\"led-spares\",\"keywords\":[\"spare\",\"spares\",\"replacement\",\"repair\",\"2%\",\"5%\",\"10%\"],\"answer\":[\"Spare modules can reduce downtime if a module needs replacement. Choose a percentage or request a custom amount.\",\"The calculator rounds spare modules up to a whole number and uses the selected pitch’s module price. Spare-module compatibility and any other spare components are confirmed with your quotation.\"],\"question\":\"Why should I include spare modules?\"},{\"id\":\"warranty\",\"title\":\"6. Review warranty cover\",\"target\":\"led-warranty\",\"keywords\":[\"warranty\",\"warrantee\",\"guarantee\",\"five year\",\"5 year\",\"cover\"],\"answer\":[\"Standard cover is included in the stated scope. Tick Add 5-year extended warranty if you want that option included.\",\"The current extended-warranty price is provisional. Full cover, exclusions and service arrangements are confirmed with your formal quotation.\"],\"question\":\"What warranty is available?\"},{\"id\":\"installation\",\"title\":\"7. Choose installation support\",\"target\":\"led-installation\",\"keywords\":[\"installation\",\"install\",\"assembly\",\"assemble\",\"commission\",\"onsite\",\"on site\",\"remote\",\"diy\"],\"answer\":[\"Installation support is useful for assembly, commissioning and more complex systems, especially custom hemispherical installations. Choose customer installation, remote support or Simworx onsite installation to match your project.\",\"Simworx will discuss suitability before order. Travel, accommodation, freight, site access and any special installation work are confirmed separately.\"],\"question\":\"Do I need Simworx installation?\"},{\"id\":\"warp\",\"title\":\"8. Set up warp and calibration\",\"target\":\"led-warpFile\",\"keywords\":[\"warp\",\"warping\",\"calibration\",\"calibrate\",\"distortion\",\"fixed screen\",\"fixed size\",\"software\",\"reset\",\"alignment\"],\"answer\":[\"Warping adjusts the image mapping to suit the screen geometry and viewing position. A preconfigured warp file is a starting setup for your agreed screen and visual system; compatible software is selected separately.\",\"A fixed-size, fixed-position screen lets you reuse the same warp file while screen geometry, viewing position, display layout, resolution and software setup remain unchanged. Routine use should not require creating a new file each time.\",\"If the physical or display setup changes, or alignment drifts, recalibration may be needed. Simworx confirms compatibility and the final calibration scope before order.\"],\"question\":\"Will I need to keep resetting the warp file?\"},{\"id\":\"quote\",\"title\":\"9. Review and keep your configuration\",\"target\":\"led-review\",\"keywords\":[\"price\",\"cost\",\"quote\",\"quotation\",\"print\",\"email\",\"save\",\"profile\",\"markup\",\"per square\",\"square metre\",\"sqm\",\"expensive\"],\"answer\":[\"Curved-screen cost is the number of whole modules multiplied by the selected pitch’s module price. The review currently uses supplier cost with no markup; equipment and service prices remain provisional. Changing dimensions, pitch or selected options updates the quote.\",\"Hemispherical screens and their custom frame are priced after review. No automatic hemispherical total is shown.\",\"Print or email your quote to keep the specification and available configuration views. Save your profile to restore the configuration later, or ask Simworx to contact you to discuss it.\"],\"question\":\"How is my screen price calculated?\"},{\"id\":\"delivery\",\"title\":\"Lead time and delivery\",\"target\":\"led-supply-terms\",\"keywords\":[\"lead time\",\"leadtime\",\"delivery\",\"deliver\",\"shipping\",\"ship\",\"freight\",\"weeks\",\"months\",\"how long\",\"when\"],\"answer\":[\"For your selected screen: estimated production lead time is {leadTime}. {leadTimeNote}\",\"Curved screens: 6–10 weeks. Custom hemispherical systems: 3–4 months. Freight, packing, destination and site access are reviewed separately. Shipping is confirmed with your formal quotation.\"],\"question\":\"How long will my screen take?\"},{\"id\":\"payment\",\"title\":\"Deposits and payment\",\"target\":\"led-supply-terms\",\"keywords\":[\"payment\",\"pay\",\"deposit\",\"upfront\",\"up front\",\"balance\",\"50%\",\"100%\",\"10k\",\"10000\",\"order\"],\"answer\":[\"{payment}\",\"There is no online checkout for this configurator. Simworx confirms the final scope, payment schedule and order arrangements with you before production.\"],\"question\":\"What are the payment terms?\"},{\"id\":\"unknown\",\"title\":\"Discuss a project-specific question\",\"target\":\"led-review\",\"keywords\":[],\"answer\":[\"I do not have an approved answer to that question. Ask Simworx to contact you from Your specification & quote and include the question with your configuration. The team can review your project before order.\"],\"question\":\"I have a different question\"}]}})},{ok:true,json:async()=>([{\"code\":\"AF\",\"name\":\"Afghanistan\"},{\"code\":\"AL\",\"name\":\"Albania\"},{\"code\":\"DZ\",\"name\":\"Algeria\"},{\"code\":\"AS\",\"name\":\"American Samoa\"},{\"code\":\"AD\",\"name\":\"Andorra\"},{\"code\":\"AO\",\"name\":\"Angola\"},{\"code\":\"AI\",\"name\":\"Anguilla\"},{\"code\":\"AQ\",\"name\":\"Antarctica\"},{\"code\":\"AG\",\"name\":\"Antigua and Barbuda\"},{\"code\":\"AR\",\"name\":\"Argentina\"},{\"code\":\"AM\",\"name\":\"Armenia\"},{\"code\":\"AW\",\"name\":\"Aruba\"},{\"code\":\"AU\",\"name\":\"Australia\"},{\"code\":\"AT\",\"name\":\"Austria\"},{\"code\":\"AZ\",\"name\":\"Azerbaijan\"},{\"code\":\"BS\",\"name\":\"Bahamas\"},{\"code\":\"BH\",\"name\":\"Bahrain\"},{\"code\":\"BD\",\"name\":\"Bangladesh\"},{\"code\":\"BB\",\"name\":\"Barbados\"},{\"code\":\"BY\",\"name\":\"Belarus\"},{\"code\":\"BE\",\"name\":\"Belgium\"},{\"code\":\"BZ\",\"name\":\"Belize\"},{\"code\":\"BJ\",\"name\":\"Benin\"},{\"code\":\"BM\",\"name\":\"Bermuda\"},{\"code\":\"BT\",\"name\":\"Bhutan\"},{\"code\":\"BO\",\"name\":\"Bolivia\"},{\"code\":\"BQ\",\"name\":\"Bonaire, Sint E